label Greeting
label CollectionIntro
if {Global_TallyRemaining} <= 0:
	jump SealedIntro
ReynaMayari: I am here for tonight's tally.
ReynaMayari: The remaining balance on Lola's ledger is [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] of [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyGoal}[/color] pesos.
ReynaMayari: Tonight, I expect at least [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyMin}[/color] pesos. Decide what you will offer. [pause=0.4]
[signal arg="open_tally_offer"]
[wait time="0.5"]
[end_timeline]

label SealedIntro
set {Variation} = range(1,7).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	ReynaMayari: Good evening, Patron of the Moon. [pause=0.4] No coins are owed tonight — I come only to offer the moon's blessing for tomorrow.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: The Silver Ledger rests sealed in Biringan, yet I still find myself walking down your lane at dusk. [pause=0.4] Choose which lunar favor shall watch over your shelves tomorrow.
elif {Variation} == 3.0:
	ReynaMayari: Another busy day in Karimlan, I see. [pause=0.4] Keep your earnings, child — let us simply read what fortune the moonlight offers for the morrow.
elif {Variation} == 4.0:
	ReynaMayari: Your grandmother's debt is long settled, yet a queen honors her friends. [pause=0.4] Come — draw tonight's moon cards before you lock the shutters.
elif {Variation} == 5.0:
	ReynaMayari: The evening air is calm over your sari-sari store. [pause=0.4] No tribute is asked of you — only tell me which blessing you wish to carry into dawn.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Still awake by the counter, suki? [pause=0.4] The silver spires owe you no ledger, only gratitude. Pick your favor for tomorrow's trade.
[signal arg="open_tally_offer"]
[wait time="0.5"]
[end_timeline]

label Generous
ReynaMayari: ...You offered [color=#9a630a]{Global_TallyOffer}[/color] pesos. More than I asked. [pause=0.5]
ReynaMayari: Only [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain. [pause=0.3] The silver spires remember generosity.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
if {Global_QuotaDay} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: Actually, I've been meaning to see what your store offers by daylight.
	ReynaMayari: Expect a visit from me soon. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: Until tomorrow. [pause=0.3]
[end_timeline]

label Success
ReynaMayari: [color=#9a630a]{Global_TallyOffer}[/color] pesos recorded in the Silver Ledger. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain on your grandmother's pact.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
if {Global_QuotaDay} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: Actually, I've been meaning to check what your store offers.
	ReynaMayari: I think I will see what you have here tomorrow. [pause=0.5]
ReynaMayari: Until tomorrow. [pause=0.3]
[end_timeline]

label Shortfall
label Angry
if {Global_TallyOffer} <= 0:
	ReynaMayari: [wave blue]Nothing at all tonight?[/wave] [pause=0.5]
	ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos still stand unpaid. Expect a chill over Karimlan tomorrow.
else:
	ReynaMayari: [wave blue]Only {Global_TallyOffer} pesos.[/wave] [pause=0.5] That falls short of tonight's expectation.
	ReynaMayari: [color=#2d527c]{Global_TallyRemaining}[/color] pesos remain. Expect... [pause=0.3] a mild chill over Karimlan tomorrow.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label MilestoneAlso
ReynaMayari: Also... [pause=0.35]
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_reroll_1
ReynaMayari: You have passed the first seal of the Silver Ledger — [color=#9a630a]Moon's Grace[/color]. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: From this night on, I will allow you a [color=#9a630a]reroll[/color] whenever the moon's cards displease you. Use it wisely.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_daytime_mayari
ReynaMayari: Your ledger has reached [color=#9a630a]Daylight Audience[/color]. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: I find myself curious about what you sell beneath the sun. Expect me at your counter during business hours from time to time.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_shifted_odds_reroll_2
ReynaMayari: Half the ledger stands paid in silver — [color=#9a630a]Silver Favor[/color] is yours. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: The moon will tilt its hand more kindly toward Favors, and I grant you a [color=#9a630a]second reroll[/color] each night.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label Milestone_twin_moons
ReynaMayari: Three-quarters of your grandmother's pact, honored — [color=#9a630a]Twin Moons[/color]. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: Henceforth, you may claim up to [color=#9a630a]two Moon Cards[/color] each night to shape tomorrow's trade.
[signal arg="check_mayari_milestones"]
[end_timeline]

label LedgerCleared
ReynaMayari: It is done. [pause=0.5]
ReynaMayari: Every last peso of your bloodline's tally has been settled.
ReynaMayari: As Queen of Biringan, I declare the pact sealed and renewed. Karimlan rests under my protection. [pause=0.4]
ReynaMayari: Keep your coins from now on, child. [pause=0.3] I will... see myself out.
[end_timeline]

label SealedOutro
set {Variation} = range(1,7).pick_random()
if {Variation} == 1.0:
	ReynaMayari: It is set in silver. [pause=0.4] Rest well tonight, Patron — tomorrow's tide will be kind to your counter.
elif {Variation} == 2.0:
	ReynaMayari: A wise choice. [pause=0.4] Lock up and get some sleep; Karimlan is safe beneath my watch.
elif {Variation} == 3.0:
	ReynaMayari: The moon hears you. [pause=0.4] May your shelves stay full and your neighbors leave smiling tomorrow.
elif {Variation} == 4.0:
	ReynaMayari: Done. [pause=0.4] Perhaps I will drop by for some candy in the daylight too. Until tomorrow.
elif {Variation} == 5.0:
	ReynaMayari: Your blessing is woven into the morning breeze. [pause=0.4] Good night, child — Lola would be proud of this little shop.
else:
	ReynaMayari: Then let tomorrow shine brightly over Karimlan. [pause=0.4] Until our next evening beneath the moon.
[end_timeline]